Applied by the Makefile to a copy of ../source.

- 64-bit host: pointer arithmetic through intptr_t rather than int (the same
  on the 32-bit original).
- insertscore shifted the table down from hiscores[23] to hiscores[24], one
  past its end: the 8 bytes after the gameinfo block. On RISC OS that was
  the next heap block's header; on libroger's heap (no headers in emulated
  memory) it's the next block itself, the sceneinfo, whose viewbuf it
  overwrote. The last entry now drops off the table instead.

